  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "key": "skill.1410.description",
    "text": "舉起旗槍，為隊友施加<style=\"accent-gn\">激勵</style>。隨後可施加二段追擊奮力躍入敵陣，對範圍內的敵方目標造成<style=\"physical\">物理傷害</style>並將其<style=\"accent-gn\">擊飛</style>，同時回復<style=\"accent-gn\">100</style>點<style=\"accent-gn\">勇氣</style>。<br><style=\"accent-gn\">激勵</style>：持續<style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>秒，期間所有隊友急速+<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>，自身每<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>秒回復<style=\"accent-gn\">10</style><style=\"accent-gn\">勇氣</style>每<style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>秒回復<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>層<style=\"accent-gn\">銳利</style>。<br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">「無盡風暴，隨吾騎士之令而解鎖強大之力！風啊，以洶湧疾馳昭示汝之榮耀！在風中顯現吧！」</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">攻略：勇氣較低時施放。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
      {
        "deployment_id": "global",
        "channel": "steam",
        "client_build": "24252055"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "source": "official-game-localization",
      "reference": "client-build:global/steam/24252055#localization-1505341103",
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  },
  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "key": "skill.1430.description",
    "text": "將自身的<style=\"accent-gn\">勇氣</style>轉換為持續的風場，對周圍目標造成<style=\"physical\">物理傷害</style>，傷害間隔受到攻擊速度屬性影響，直到<style=\"accent-gn\">勇氣</style>消散，每<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>秒消耗<style=\"accent-gn\">16</style>點<style=\"accent-gn\">勇氣</style>，再次點擊可關閉技能。<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">攻略：盡可能使得勇氣風環的持續時間最大化，除了在勇氣滿額時施放外施放過程中要透過一定的手段回復勇氣。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
